# Custom secrets for Edge Functions, loaded locally by `supabase functions serve --env-file`.
# Copy to supabase/functions/.env (git-ignored). Never commit real values.
# Set in production with `supabase secrets set NAME=value`.
#
# The Edge Runtime injects SUPABASE_URL, SUPABASE_ANON_KEY, SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY and
# SUPABASE_DB_URL into every function itself. The SUPABASE_ prefix is reserved, so don't list
# those here. Read them with Deno.env.get().
#
# No custom secrets yet (Phase 0). Add one line per secret, with an empty value:
# EXAMPLE_API_KEY=
